    <string name="remote_help">Remote: ▲▼ — channel switching, OK or ◀ — channel list, ▶ — programme guide, digits — channel number, “Menu” — quality and stream source, long OK in the list — favourite.\nPhone: tap — control panel, swipe up/down — next/previous channel.</string>

    <string name="about_header">Android/Android TV IPTV player</string>
    <string name="about_body">• Built-in playlists: Beeline and Wink TV. More sources can be added in settings.\n• Wink/Beeline links are decoded the same way as in Nexterr video scripts: base64 → reverse → base64, ClearKey from token= or decryption_key.\n• Programme guide: iptvx.one lite, additional sources are available in settings.\n• Archive: Wink ?offset=-N, Beeline ?starttime&amp;stoptime, others via catchup-source.\n• Merging identical channels and automatic source failover works like TVSources.</string>

